e digital infrastructure for the Formula 1 Saudi Arabian Grand Prix, making it the company’s third consecutive year of partnership.\nIn 2021, Saudi Arabia's Public Investment Fund (PIF) sold 120 million shares in Saudi Telecom Company (stc Group) for $3.2 billion after completing a secondary share offering of stc Group.\nIn December 2019, the company launched a new identity, and the names of its branches in Bahrain and Kuwait were changed from VIVA to stc Kuwait and stc Bahrain. In June 2021, the Central Bank of Saudi Arabia approved the conversion of the Saudi Digital Payments Company (stc Pay) into a digital bank.","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","createdAt":"2026-05-03T09:57:20.947Z"},{"id":"cd36f4c1-bde4-4034-903e-0d2c254f8a91","queryId":"cde87678-7e9d-4085-a566-9c94ef0a1143","title":"Power & Tel – Your Supply Chain Partner | Power & Tel","url":"https://www.ptsupply.com/","snippet":"Let&#x27;s work together to solve your supply chain challenges. Learn More · Founded in 1963, <strong>Power &amp; Tel</strong> is an industry leader in sales, material management, and distribution solutions for the global telecommunications industry.\nWe'll manage your inventory and logistics, so you can stay focused on your services. Let's work together to solve your supply chain challenges. Learn More · Founded in 1963, Power & Tel is an industry leader in sales, material management, and distribution solutions for the global telecommunications industry.\nPower & Tel is bringing value to those building the broadband highways. We are your one-stop-inventory source securing the equipment for your network builds.","domain":"ptsupply.com","createdAt":"2026-05-03T09:57:20.947Z"},{"id":"9ebcf81d-fab5-47c0-a3bc-e718ea4b8d7b","queryId":"cde87678-7e9d-4085-a566-9c94ef0a1143","title":"SunCoast | New & Refurbished Parts, Network Services, and More","url":"https://scctelcom.com/","snippet":"At <strong>SunCoast Communications</strong>, we take pride in being one of the leading value-added suppliers 